sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Trigger as RetryScheduler / ReconciliationService
    participant PaymentService
    participant WalletService
    participant Ledger
    participant NotificationService
    participant AuditLog
    actor Customer

    Trigger->>PaymentService: Report biller refusal or reconciliation result
    Note over Trigger,PaymentService: Valid refund trigger: biller refused, or Unknown later refused / no payment found

    PaymentService->>PaymentService: Load Payment and inspect current state

    alt Payment is SentToBiller or Unknown with confirmed refusal / no payment found
        PaymentService->>PaymentService: Set state to Failed
        Note over PaymentService: Payment state: Failed
    else Payment is Unknown with no confirmed refusal
        Note over PaymentService: Payment state: Unknown
        Note over PaymentService,WalletService: Do nothing&#59; keep funds held and wait for reconciliation
    end

    alt Payment is already Refunded (duplicate trigger)
        PaymentService->>PaymentService: Ignore duplicate refund request
        PaymentService->>AuditLog: Log duplicate trigger&#59; no second refund
    else Payment is Failed and not yet Refunded
        PaymentService->>WalletService: Release hold (352.50 EGP)

        Note over WalletService,Ledger: One hold release produces exactly 2 ledger entries
        WalletService->>Ledger: Decrease held balance by 352.50 EGP
        Ledger-->>WalletService: Entry recorded
        WalletService->>Ledger: Increase available balance by 352.50 EGP
        Ledger-->>WalletService: Entry recorded

        WalletService-->>PaymentService: Hold released successfully
        PaymentService->>PaymentService: Set state to Refunded
        Note over PaymentService: Payment state: Refunded

        PaymentService->>AuditLog: Record refund (who, when, why, amount)
        PaymentService->>NotificationService: Send refund SMS
        PaymentService->>NotificationService: Send refund push

        loop 3 times&#59; retry failed SMS delivery
            NotificationService->>NotificationService: Retry SMS delivery
        end
        Note over NotificationService: If SMS still fails after 3 retries, marked undelivered

        NotificationService->>Customer: Notify refund outcome through SMS and push
    end

    Note over PaymentService,Customer: Completed payments are never refunded by this flow